From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(facts): a job the owner says ended is kept as past_role,
 not corrected away (3235)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

MASTER TEST RUN ME-024: „ბახვა „სანიმუშო ბანკიდან" წამოვიდა, ახლა
„საცდელ ლოჯისტიკაში" მუშაობს." The model called correct_contact_fact on
the bank, which retracts the row AND writes a veto — so „who used to work
at the bank?" could no longer name him.

When the owner's line says the job ended (წამოვიდა, აღარ მუშაობს, left,
больше не работает …) and the correction is of a job field, the present
row is retracted, the same value is saved as past_role in the owner's
word, and no veto is written. Any other correction is as before.

